Well, if your first ascensions were during the time of NH3.1.3 (as mine 
were), then reflection would indeed have been unnecessary.  As soon as 
you had AC -18, you would not be hit by wands anymore (and I did some 
ascensions where I did not bother about reflection either, because I had 
reached AC -18 before having a source).  Nowadays, reflection is much 
more necessary.  Of course, one might get by without, but it is also 
possible to lose important stuff (your wand of death, your ring of 
levitation while on air or fire), solely by bad luck.  I am not sure 
that I like this, because I like the fact very much that the game 
becomes the more deterministic (or controllable) the longer you have 
played.  IMO, you should not lose due to a whim of the RNG in late game, 
if you don't make mistakes.
